  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "どくに　そまった　しょくしゅや　うでで\nあいてを　つきさす。\nどく　じょうたいに　することが　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "독에 물든 촉수나 팔로\n상대를 꿰찌른다.\n독 상태로 만들 때가 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "以帶有毒性的觸手或手臂刺進對手。\n有時會讓對手陷入中毒狀態。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Attaque l’ennemi avec un tentacule, un bras,\nou un autre membre plein de poison.\nPeut aussi l’empoisonner.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Der Anwender greift mit giftigen Gliedmaßen wie\nTentakeln oder Armen an. Das Ziel wird dabei\neventuell vergiftet.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Pincha al objetivo con un tentáculo o brazo\nenvenenado. Puede llegar a envenenar al objetivo. ",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Il bersaglio è colpito da un tentacolo o da un arto\nintriso di una sostanza tossica che può anche\navvelenarlo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The target is stabbed with a tentacle, arm, or the like\nsteeped in poison. This may also poison the target.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "毒に　そまった　触手や　腕で\n相手を　突き刺す。\n毒状態に　することが　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用带毒的触手或手臂\n刺入对手。\n有时会让对手陷入中毒状态。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Pincha al objetivo con un tentáculo o brazo\nenvenenado. Puede llegar a envenenar al objetivo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
